{
  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6m Alexander h\u00e6fde gefeoht wi\u00f0 Porose \u00fe\u00e6m strengstan Indea cyninge. On \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte w\u00e6ron \u00fea m\u00e6stan blodgytas on \u00e6g\u00feere healfe \u00feara folca. On \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte Poros & Alexander gefuhton anwig of horsum. \u00dea ofslog Poros Alexandres hors, \u00fee Bucefal w\u00e6s haten, & hiene selfne mehte, \u00fe\u00e6r him his \u00feegnas & he h\u00e6fde Poros monegum wundum gewundodne, & hiene eac gewildne gedyde, si\u00fe\u00fean his & him eft his rice to forlet for his \u00feegnscipe, \u00fey he swa swi\u00f0e w\u00e6s feohtende ongean hiene. & he Alexander him het si\u00fe\u00fean twa byrg atimbran: o\u00feer w\u00e6s hatenu be his horse Bucefal, o\u00feer Si\u00fe\u00fean he for on R\u00e6stas \u00fea leode, & on Cathenas & on Presidas, & an Gangeridas, & wi\u00f0 hie ealle \u00dea he com on India eastgem\u00e6ra, \u00fea com him \u00fe\u00e6r ongean twa hund \u00feusenda monna gehorsades Si\u00fe\u00fean \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he wolde habban maran wicstowa \u00feonne his gewuna \u00e6r w\u00e6re, for \u00feon he him \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for ut on garsecg of \u00fe\u00e6m mu\u00fean, \u00fee seo ea w\u00e6s hatenu Eginense, on an iglond, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for to \u00fe\u00e6m iglande, \u00fee monn \u00fe\u00e6t folc Mandras h\u00e6tt, & Subagros; & hi him brohton & hie lange w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t dreogende \u00e6r heora a\u00f0er mehte on o\u00f0rum sige ger\u00e6can, \u00e6r Alexander late \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he gefor to anum f",
